</div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-line-height-alt:.75pt"><span style=3D"f=
ont-size:1.0pt;color:white">Good morning, I'm writing with concern about Th=
orwin Properties non-compliance with fire related procedure and protocol. O=
n January 14 around 7 pm the main building
 fire alarm was triggered. It continued until a tenant called 911 in order =
<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-line-height-alt:.75pt"><span style=3D"f=
ont-size:1.0pt;color:white"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Good morning,<o:p></o:p></p>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">I'm writing with concern about Thorwin Properties no=
n-compliance with fire related procedure and protocol.<o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">On January 14 around 7 pm the main building fire ala=
rm was triggered. It continued until a tenant called 911 in order to alert =
the fire department who can only turn off the alarm at the building. The is=
sue appears to be a failure in compliance
 in which the tenant responsible for the smoke produced by burning food was=
 not informed about fire&nbsp;safety procedure and protocol. In addition, t=
he reason for the main alarm system being triggered is due to the tenant be=
ing unable to open the windows in their
 suite and allow&nbsp;exit for the smoke.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">The tenant in question is a family of newcomers and =
they should not be held responsible for their ignorance of procedure when l=
anguage difficulties are a factor.&nbsp;Fire safety protocol documentation =
do not appear to be available through Thorwin
 Properties, and if they do exist, they were not communicated to the tenant=
 in an effective manner, endangering the safety of the community and requir=
ing me to take an active role in the protection of the community by organiz=
ing response.<o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">An investigation is needed into the building's alarm=
 system and its communication with authorities and signage and documentatio=
n necessary to inform tenants of protocol and procedure. My understanding i=
s that the alarm does not communicate
 its triggering with the authorities and it is required&nbsp;that the tenan=
ts contact 911 in order to call the fire department and have the officers c=
ome to turn off the alarm.<o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">The property manager, Grant Steele, arrived at the e=
xact same time as the fire response team and did not check in with all buil=
ding residents to confirm that there was no danger after the alarm was turn=
ed off.<o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">It appears that Thorwin Properties does not have an =
effective plan or communication of plan for procedure and this constitutes =
a serious safety issue for the tenants of the building. It also appears tha=
t the windows are a safety issue and
 their functioning needs to be assessed.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Thank you,<o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Evan Rosner<o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
